<title>ITALY: Genoa Jan-May air cargo up 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Genoa Jan-May air cargo up 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic handled through Genoa rose 4.1 percent during the first five months of 1997 compared to the same period in 1996, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>Details included:</p>
<p>    Genoa	 Jan-May 97   Jan-May 96  Pct Change</p>
<p>    Cargo Tonnes     2,053	1,972	 up 4.1</p>
<p>    Mail Tonnes	1,056	1,108     down 5.9</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
